   ents. Res. Pap. PNW-338. Portland, OR: HELVEY, J.D., TIEDEMANN, A.R.         
   and ANDERSON, T.D. 1985. Plant nutrient losses by soil erosion and ma        
   ss movement after wildfire. Journal of Soil and Water Conservation 40        
   (1): 168-173. GEIST, J.M. and EDGERTON, P.J. 1984. Fourwing saltbush         
   establishment in the Keating uniform shrub garden--first year results        
   . Res. Note PNW-416. Portland, OR: U.S. Department of Agriculture, Fo        
   rest Service GEIST, J.M. and EDGERTON, P.J. 1984. Performance tests o        
